# Shell scripts are executed inside Alpine containers: a CRLF checkout on a Windows dev
# machine must never reach them, or /bin/sh fails on the invisible \r.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Deployed and checked by sha256 (Aşama A's device->bed table, the inventories): the bytes a Windows
# checkout holds — and that deploy/infinity/device_beds_review.py hashes — must be the bytes git
# holds and the VM receives.
deploy/infinity/*.json text eol=lf
